 Fail when particles become generic haze, atmosphere expands or disappears, reflections break, masks halo, assets float, contact shadows are missing, or integration requires redrawing protected assets.
 
+For a photographic narrow edit, inspect the protected relationships relevant to that image: source position and subject/background illumination, permitted shadow or unreadable zones, skin/material color under the environment, viewpoint and near/far scale, crop, focus plane, and background detail level. A prop fix that sharpens the background or an identity fix that lifts facial fill fails preservation even if the named prop or face improves. Keep intrinsic surface color/texture separate from illumination; a light correction that invents pores, seams, or material relief is not a clean light correction. Preserve intentional even top light, deep focus, and non-realistic optics rather than imposing a generic cinematic look.
+
+Use `Uncertain` when comparison scale, source evidence, or tool control cannot support a verdict. Image histograms or encoded pixel samples may aid matched comparisons but do not reveal physical lux, on-set exposure stops, actual lens, or aperture. Prompt wording and a claimed lock are not evidence that protected pixels survived.
+
 ### 10. Delivery honesty and traceability
 
 Pass when outputs, roles, settings, accepted and rejected intermediates, limitations, and observed drift are accurately reported. A package is called editable only when it contains genuinely editable data.
